WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.310
The Qur'an names 25 prophets: Adam, Noah,

2
00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:08.430
Abraham, Moses, David, Jesus, and more.

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:14.330
One report speaks of 124,000 in all,
though scholars differ on how strong that

4
00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.700
report is.

5
00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:19.690
Muslims believe some also brought
books: the Torah to Moses,

6
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:23.040
the Psalms to David, the Gospel to Jesus.

7
00:00:23.090 --> 00:00:28.590
So if God had already sent all these, why
do Muslims believe they need the Qur'an?

8
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:32.360
In this mission, you'll unpick
three words the Qur'an uses:

9
00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:35.200
prophet, messenger and warner.

10
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.670
Then you'll line up the five
books Muslims believe God sent,

11
00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:40.840
and the prophets who received them.

12
00:00:40.890 --> 00:00:45.480
Your mission: find out why Muslims
believe the Qur'an is still needed.
